WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.969
Bird did not like having a neighbor.

2
00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:11.648
Kip was loud and he dropped acorns.

3
00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:18.456
"I need a break," said Bird.

4
00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:24.040
"I think I'll go to the beach."

5
00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:35.862
Bird walked in the sand.

6
00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:50.957
She dipped her toes in the water.

7
00:00:50.958 --> 00:01:01.583
She ate a snack.

8
00:01:01.584 --> 00:01:05.835
"I love the beach," she said.

9
00:01:05.836 --> 00:01:09.729
Just then Bird saw something.

10
00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.521
There was a big hawk in the sky!

11
00:01:12.522 --> 00:01:15.750
"Oh no!" said Bird.

12
00:01:15.751 --> 00:01:20.392
"That hawk will eat me!"

13
00:01:20.393 --> 00:01:30.487
Bird found a good place to hide.

14
00:01:30.488 --> 00:01:41.925
At last the hawk was gone.

15
00:01:41.926 --> 00:01:45.809
Bird flew back home.

16
00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:53.729
"I saw a big hawk!" said Bird.

17
00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.204
"Oh no!" said Kip.

18
00:01:56.205 --> 00:02:00.684
"I don't like hawks! Where was it?"

19
00:02:00.685 --> 00:02:04.833
"It was at the beach," said Bird.

20
00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:08.395
"Will it come here?" asked Kip.

21
00:02:08.396 --> 00:02:11.448
"I don't think so," said Bird.

22
00:02:11.449 --> 00:02:17.289
"This tree is a very safe place."

